WHY GPL-2.0

ConforM-Agent invokes Open Babel (GPL-2.0) and MDAnalysis (GPL-2.0+) and
is designed to integrate GNINA (GPL-2.0). Distributing this project as a
combined work therefore requires a GPL-compatible license. See
docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for the full third-party license audit.

Third-party components retain their own licenses:
  RDKit           BSD-3-Clause
  fpocket         MIT / BSD-3-Clause
  AutoDock Vina   Apache-2.0
  Open Babel      GPL-2.0
  MDAnalysis      GPL-2.0+
  Streamlit       Apache-2.0
  py3Dmol         BSD-3-Clause
